1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
You can make a t-shirt into a dress without ever touching the 2D pattern window.

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:07,040
You can use the style line tools and a default shirt to do this.

3
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:12,560
Use the edit style line tool to move existing seams or hems into any shape you want.

4
00:00:13,439 --> 00:00:16,640
Then with the scale style line tool, I can widen the bottom of the shirt.

5
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:20,320
Use the move style line tool to increase or decrease the length of a seam.

6
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:22,240
I'll do this twice because I want a longer dress.

7
00:00:24,719 --> 00:00:29,839
Then I'll use the draw style line tool to create my waist seam.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Going back to the scale style line tool to narrow the waist.

